                speaker: None,
                text: "「没事啦。比起这个，今天有新的床要送过来吧」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00104",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「嗯？没错，应该是在中午之前送过来」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1004"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00105",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「那让我来帮忙吧，\u{3000}那东西重得很，爸你一个人搬会很吃力的」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00106",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我一边说着，一边开始真正地换衣服。校服和书包被扔在了一旁。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00107",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「唉，你愿意帮忙我是很高兴啦……」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1005"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00108",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「没关系啦」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00109",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "对着稍微露出不快表情的老爸，我轻轻地挥了挥手。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00110",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "如今我就像这样，开始帮助家里的各种工作。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00111",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "以前的我帮不上忙，而现在却能像这样做不少事。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00112",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "如果不是这样，像这间养老院的规模，除了我的父母，就没有其他的员工工作了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00113",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "母亲整日忙碌于准备养老院里20多人的伙食。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00114",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "即便偶尔妹妹也会帮忙，每天，三餐的时候也让母亲没有休息的时间。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00115",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "所以，不知从何时起我也……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00116",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "开始帮忙干些杂活，也不会因为和父亲说话口气随意，而被批评了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00117",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "虽说还是初中生，但父亲已经把我当作够得上大人的人来对待了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00118",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「不过你啊……\u{3000}要是翘课太多，到时候被留级了我可不管啊」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1006"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00119",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「那种事，到时候再说啦」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00120",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "说着我走向中庭。准备去迎接日常来往的相关公司的车。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00121",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "n4bg_002a",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "看了下手表，早上9点半。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00122",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "刚好是第一节课上到一半的时间，当然我并没有去学校的打算。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00123",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "说实在的，翘课对我来说已经是家常便饭。自从上了初中以后，至少缺勤了一半课程。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00124",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是，不仅是要帮家里做事的时候，即使家里没事我也多半不去。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00125",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我只是单纯觉得那个叫学校的地方，太麻烦了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00126",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "老实说，只是因为义务教育所以没办法。我并不觉得有任何上学的价值。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00127",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "在我周围，也有很多不去上学的人。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00128",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "既有隐瞒了年龄出去找工作的，也有很多像我这样埋头在家里帮忙做事的。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00129",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "……所以这样的人并不是只有我而已。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00130",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "至少比起将来的升学，更想把重心放到现在的生活上吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00131",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―那刚建成的填海工厂的时薪很不错。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00132",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "每当有这种消息传来时，不管是几年级的学生，都会有大批人蜂拥而至。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00133",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "……１９７０年代。就是这样一个时代……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00134",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "b",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "sora07",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "某一天深夜。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00135",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "家里的一位老奶奶身体状况忽然恶化。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00136",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "即使已经有过好几次类似的经历，但在那一瞬间，我还是不由得变得不知所措。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00137",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「还愣在那做什么呢，快去叫救护车啊」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1007"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00138",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「啊，好的，知道了」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00139",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "一边回答的同时，我冲向聊天室。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00140",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "只有那里和家人的房间才有电话。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00141",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "b",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: play_se,
            args: (
                file: "call119",
                channel: Some(1),
                volume: Some(0.78431374),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "拿起话筒，我立刻拨打了119。明明已经不是第一次，手指却一直抖个不停。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00142",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「喂喂，这里是莳绘之家，请立马过来。这里有人发病了」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00143",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "一口气说完了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00144",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「请先冷静下来」",
                voice: Some("li/etcm2_1001e"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00145",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「啊，好的，抱歉……」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00146",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「莳绘之家的话，\u{3000}应该是说二丁目的养老院吧」",
                voice: Some("li/etcm2_1002e"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00147",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "在那之后，对方询问了病情和年龄，并表示会指派救护车过来。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00148",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "与纵使经历多次也依然难以习惯的我不同，对方表现得非常冷静。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00149",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: play_se,
            args: (
                file: "kurodenwa_tin",
                channel: Some(1),
                volume: Some(0.78431374),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "n4bg_009c",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "……呼。挂掉电话后，我轻轻吐了一口气。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00150",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "总之救护车已经叫了，接下来应该需要联系家人了吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00151",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "做出决定以后，我准备从拿到的联系簿上拨打电话……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00152",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 400,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "就在那时，",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00153",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「不用了博史」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1008"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00154",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "是父亲。不知何时已经站在了我的身后。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00155",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「不用了……难道说状态已经稳定了吗？」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00156",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「那倒不是，只是不用通知家人」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1009"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00157",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我完全无法理解。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00158",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "考虑到那个人的年纪，情况不好的话，可能会就此离开人世。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00159",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这意味着，再也无法和家人相见。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00160",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "至少，把老人送到这里的家人，也一定预想过会有这样的情况发生。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00161",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "正因如此，这种情况下我们理应联系他们才对吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00162",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "虽然不清楚是出于义务还是法律，但我个人是这样认为的……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00163",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "当我还在想那些事的时候，父亲继续对我说。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00164",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「博史……现在几点？」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1010"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00165",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「咦，嗯……３点吧。凌晨」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00166",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「所以你应该也很清楚吧？」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1011"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00167",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "父亲这样回答。即便我能理解，也难以接受。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00168",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "的确在这个时间段打电话对她家人来说很唐突……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00169",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「她的家人也有自己的工作和安排」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1012"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00170",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「他们不像你，因为觉得困，就随便翘课」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1013"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00171",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「不是，这个我也知道……」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00172",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "对依然无法接受的我，父亲叹了一口气……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00173",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「只有在去世的时候才能打紧急电话。\u{3000}除此之外都不行」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1014"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00174",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「爸……再怎么说这也太……」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00175",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「这就是这里的规则。\u{3000}决不能改变」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1015"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00176",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「……………」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00177",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "面对父亲强硬干脆的回答。我不禁哑口无言。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00178",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「喂博史，你可不要误会了。\u{3000}这不只是家属方面的意思」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1016"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00179",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「她本人也是，这么希望的…」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1017"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00180",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「……本人？」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00181",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「是啊，现在的你还没法理解吧……」",
                voice: Some("li/np4papa_1018"),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00182",
            ),
        ),
